{"path":"chrono/year/operator_ltlt","title":"std::chrono::operator<<(std::chrono::year)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::</span>operator&lt;&lt;<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(std::chrono::year)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/year/operator_ltlt","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"Forms a std::basic_string<CharT> s consisting of the year value stored in y formatted as a decimal number, left-padded with 0 to four digits if the result would otherwise be less than four digits.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/chrono\">&lt;chrono&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Traits <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; operator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> os, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year\"><span class=\"kw2636\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">year</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> y <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Forms a <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1236\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">s</span></code> consisting of the year value stored in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">y</span></code> formatted as a decimal number, left-padded with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code> to four digits if the result would otherwise be less than four digits. Then, if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy3\">!</span>y.<span class=\"me1\">ok</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, append <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">\" is not a valid year\"</span></span></code> to the formatted string. Inserts that string into <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">os</span></code>.\n</p><p>Equivalent to\n</p><p><span class=\"t-cc\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> os <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>y.<span class=\"me1\">ok</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">?</span><br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/format/format\"><span class=\"kw3165\">std::<span class=\"me2\">format</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>STATICALLY_WIDEN<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"{:%Y}\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, y<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span><br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/format/format\"><span class=\"kw3165\">std::<span class=\"me2\">format</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>STATICALLY_WIDEN<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"{:%Y} is not a valid year\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, y<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></span>\n</p><p>where <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">STATICALLY_WIDEN<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"...\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">\"...\"</span></span></code> if <code>CharT</code> is <code>char</code>, and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">L<span class=\"st0\">\"...\"</span></span></code> if <code>CharT</code> is <code>wchar_t</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">os</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;chrono&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year\"><span class=\"kw2636\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">year</span></span></a> y1<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">2020</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, y2<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu8\">020</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, y3<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">98304</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> y1 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> y2 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> y3 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>2020\n-0016\n-32768 is not a valid year</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/format/format\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>format</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  stores formatted representation of the arguments in a new string <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year/formatter\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>std::formatter<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">&lt;std::chrono::year&gt;</span></span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  formatting support for <code>year</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template specialization)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chrono/year","title":"std::chrono::year"}],"children":[],"map":